  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance to improve private sector competitive for small-medium business development focusing on key growth sectors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support governments across the region with technical assistance to improve private sector competitiveness and provide direct support to ODA eligible Caribbean (Belize, Dominica, Grenada, Guyan, Jamaica, Saint Lucia, and Saint Vincent and the Grenadines) businesses, entrepreneurs and regional private sector institutions to help them grow, adapt to climate change and to create jobs. Support to firms and clusters of firms in high growth potential sectors to improve productivity, expand exports, create jobs and adapt to climate change. identification and implementation of reforms aimed at improving the &#x201c;investment and doing business&#x201d; environment. Promote and produce Research and Development for climate innovation in the public and private sectors. Mainstream gender and inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
